WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.880
It means excellence never comes without sacrifice.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:34.560
It means worthwhile rewards never come for
free.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:50.660
It means circumstances can never become an
excuse.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:04.020
It means time spent improving is never wasted.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:24.840
It means quitting is never an option.

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:41.510
It means the choice to go farther in competition
and in life is mine alone to make and in the

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:45.690
end is worth every step.

